              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Mesh and Sidecar",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Service mesh== moves networking out of app code into the infrastructure layer",
                "Covers mTLS, retries, timeouts, load balancing, metrics, tracing",
                "==Sidecar==: a proxy container (Envoy) beside every service instance",
                "It intercepts **all** inbound and outbound traffic"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
